{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23085","headline":"房家夜宴喜雪戏赠主人 · 白居易","name":"房家夜宴喜雪戏赠主人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风头向夜利如刀，赖此温炉輭锦袍。\n桑落气薰珠翠暖，柘枝声引管弦高。\n酒钩送醆推莲子，烛泪黏盘垒蒲萄。\n不醉遣侬争散得，门前雪片似鹅毛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23085.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23085","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}